  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Urban Durable Solutions, Pemba, Cabo Delgado</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to analyse the interaction processes between IDPs and host communities in a second significative neighborhood (Muxara) relying on gender-sensitive participatory planning approaches. SDC&apos;s contribution will enable zooming in this neighborhood as a sample of possible integration challenges and solutions in a peri-urban area. The funding increase will ensure that the multidimensional and integrated approach can be developed in a second demonstrative area with different characteristics and densities where prioritized durable solutions in terms of improvements in service and community infrastructure will also take place. It will support local authorities in providing support services, particularly to displaced women and girls. The services will include peacebuilding and social cohesion activities, mental health, and psychosocial support, among others.</narrative>
  </description>
